  contentsAnswer: A spring-driven music mechanism for restoration. No batteries.
  weightAnswer: About eight kilos including the protective case.
  metalAnswer: Brass gears, steel springs and the carrying case hardware.
  packingAnswer: It is mounted on a moving suspension. The spring is still wound.
  responseAnswer: It can react after a short delay and pull its counterweight back.
    That is why I said spring-driven, not an empty box.
  authorReasoning: Counter-motion and delayed response have a legitimate disclosed
    clockwork cause, supported by metal-rich load. Same response vocabulary as some
    Mimics.
